<% title "Pitch playground (Fuime)" %>

<%# FUIME: the demo control room. One venture flagged Playground Mode on the
    same production app; three personas; Become is existing admin impersonate.
    Safe while Stripe is live — checkout never calls Stripe. %>

<% impersonating = current_session&.impersonated? %>
<% event = @status[:event] %>
<% teen = @status[:teen] %>
<% guardian = @status[:guardian] %>
<% new_founder = @status[:new_founder] %>
<% offer = @status[:published_offer] %>
<% seeded = event.present? && teen.present? %>
<% storefront_url = event ? fuime_storefront_url(slug: event.slug) : nil %>
<% pay_url = event && offer ? fuime_payment_page_url(event_slug: event.slug, offer: offer.to_param) : nil %>

<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 flex-wrap">
  <h1 class="mb0">Pitch playground</h1>
  <p class="muted text-sm mb0">
    Stripe <strong><%= @status[:stripe_live] ? "live" : "test" %></strong>
    · <code><%= @status[:slug] %></code>
    <% if seeded %>
      · reset <%= time_ago_in_words(@status[:last_seeded_at]) %> ago
      · <%= pluralize(@status[:ledger_lines], "ledger line") %>
    <% else %>
      · not seeded yet
    <% end %>
  </p>
</div>
<p class="mt1">
  One venture in Playground Mode on this deploy. Nothing on it moves real money;
  its Buy button never reaches Stripe. <strong>Become</strong> is the existing
  admin impersonation — an hour-long session you leave with <em>Exit demo</em>
  on the blue strip.
</p>

<% if @status[:warnings].any? %>
  <div class="card mb2">
    <h2 class="mt0 text-lg">Warnings</h2>
    <ul class="mb0">
      <% @status[:warnings].each do |warning| %>
        <li><%= warning %></li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </div>
<% end %>

<% if impersonating %>
  <div class="card mb2 border b--info">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 flex-wrap">
      <p class="mb0">
        You're currently
        <strong><%= current_user(allow_unverified: true)&.name.presence || current_user(allow_unverified: true)&.email %></strong>.
        Open a page from the script below, or come back to yourself.
      </p>
      <%= button_to "Back to admin",
                    unimpersonate_user_path(current_user(allow_unverified: true)&.id, return_to: playground_admin_index_path),
                    method: :post,
                    class: "btn bg-accent",
                    form: { data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } } %>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%# ── Start ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<div class="card mb2">
  <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
    <div class="flex-1" style="min-width: 16rem;">
      <h2 class="mt0 mb1 text-lg">Start the demo</h2>
      <p class="muted mb0 text-sm">
        One click resets Maya's venture — ledger rewritten with recent dates, the
        two sample products restored, the welcome tour re-armed, Sam wiped back to
        a blank slate — and signs you in as Maya on her home page.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap items-center">
      <%= button_to "Reset & start as Maya",
                    playground_start_admin_index_path,
                    method: :post,
                    class: "btn bg-success",
                    form: { data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } } %>
      <% reset_label = seeded ? "Reset only" : "Seed the playground" %>
      <%= button_to reset_label,
                    playground_seed_admin_index_path,
                    method: :post,
                    class: "btn bg-muted",
                    form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Rewrite the playground ledger, restore the sample products, and reset Sam?" } } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%# ── Personas ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<h2 class="mb1">Three people, in pitch order</h2>
<div class="grid grid--wide mb2">
  <div class="card flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div>
      <span class="badge bg-muted m0">1 · Signing up</span>
      <h3 class="mt1 mb0">Sam</h3>
      <p class="muted text-sm mb0">A founder who has never used Fuime. Lands on the very first screen.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm mb0">
      Watch a teenager sign up: name and 13+, their business, their parent's
      email, and a venture of their own the moment they submit.
    </p>
    <p class="muted text-xs mb0">
      <code><%= Fuime::Playground::NEW_FOUNDER_EMAIL %></code>
      <% if new_founder %>
        · <%= @status[:new_founder_fresh] ? "fresh" : "mid-demo — reset puts them back" %>
      <% end %>
    </p>
    <div class="mt-auto pt2">
      <%= button_to "Start fresh as Sam",
                    playground_fresh_founder_admin_index_path,
                    method: :post,
                    class: "btn bg-accent",
                    form: { data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } } %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div>
      <span class="badge bg-muted m0">2 · Running it</span>
      <h3 class="mt1 mb0">Maya</h3>
      <p class="muted text-sm mb0">16. Runs Maya's Lawn Care — vetted, listing, getting paid.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm mb0">
      Home with the checklist done, what she sells with a share link and QR,
      the storefront a customer sees, and a ledger with a Fuime service fee on it.
    </p>
    <p class="muted text-xs mb0"><code><%= Fuime::Playground::TEEN_EMAIL %></code></p>
    <div class="mt-auto pt2 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
      <% if seeded %>
        <%= button_to "Become Maya",
                      impersonate_user_path(teen.id, return_to: event_path(event)),
                      method: :post,
                      class: "btn bg-accent",
                      form: { data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } } %>
      <% else %>
        <span class="muted text-sm">Seed first.</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div>
      <span class="badge bg-muted m0">3 · Watching over it</span>
      <h3 class="mt1 mb0">Denise</h3>
      <p class="muted text-sm mb0">Maya's parent. Signed the guardian agreement; sees everything.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm mb0">
      The guardian overview: every venture she signed for, every transaction,
      and where payouts go. Maya can't turn that off.
    </p>
    <p class="muted text-xs mb0"><code><%= Fuime::Playground::GUARDIAN_EMAIL %></code></p>
    <div class="mt-auto pt2">
      <% if seeded && guardian %>
        <%= button_to "Become Denise",
                      impersonate_user_path(guardian.id, return_to: guardianships_path),
                      method: :post,
                      class: "btn bg-accent",
                      form: { data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } } %>
      <% else %>
        <span class="muted text-sm">Seed first.</span>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<% if seeded %>
  <%# ── Show the room ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="card mb2">
    <div class="flex gap-4 flex-wrap items-start">
      <div class="flex-1" style="min-width: 16rem;">
        <h2 class="mt0 mb1 text-lg">Let the room buy something</h2>
        <p class="text-sm mb2">
          The storefront is public. Anyone can scan this, press <strong>Buy</strong>,
          and see the thank-you screen — no card is charged and nothing is written.
          When <em>you</em> press Buy while being Maya, the sale lands on her ledger.
        </p>
        <p class="mb1">
          <strong>Storefront</strong>
          <%= link_to storefront_url, storefront_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "break-all" %>
        </p>
        <% if pay_url %>
          <p class="mb0">
            <strong><%= offer.name %></strong> — <%= offer.price_sentence %>
            <br>
            <%= link_to pay_url, pay_url, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "break-all" %>
          </p>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <% if pay_url %>
        <div class="text-center">
          <%# Server-rendered so it works on the admin bundle, which does not
              register the <qr-code> element the app bundle uses. %>
          <%= fuime_qr_svg(pay_url) %>
          <p class="muted text-xs mt1 mb0">Scan to buy — no real charge</p>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# ── Script ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
  <div class="card mb2">
    <h2 class="mt0 mb1 text-lg">The three-minute script</h2>
    <ol class="steps mb0 mt2">
      <li>
        <strong>Start fresh as Sam.</strong> Sign up as a teenager would: name,
        13+, the business, a parent's email. Submit — a venture exists immediately.
        <span class="muted">Exit demo from the strip when you're done.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Reset &amp; start as Maya.</strong> The welcome screen and a five-bubble
        tour, then <%= link_to "Home", event_path(event) %>: the checklist is complete
        and the balance is real.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><%= link_to "What you sell", fuime_offers_path(event_slug: event.slug) %>.</strong>
        Maya named it and priced it. Copy the link, show the QR, or
        <%= link_to "add something", new_fuime_offer_path(event_slug: event.slug) %> live.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><%= link_to "Storefront", fuime_storefront_path(slug: event.slug) %>.</strong>
        What a customer sees. Press <strong>Buy</strong> — the thank-you page, then
        back to <%= link_to "Transactions", event_transactions_path(event_id: event.slug) %>:
        it's on the ledger, with the Fuime service fee pending next to it.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Become Denise.</strong> <%= link_to "The guardian overview", guardianships_path %>:
        what a parent sees, and the part a teenager can't switch off.
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
<% end %>

<p class="muted text-sm">
  <strong>Any other venture</strong> can join the playground: Settings → Admin →
  <em>Is in Playground Mode?</em>. It gets the strip, may publish listings, and its
  Buy button mocks; only Maya's venture gets the seeded ledger and the recorded sale.
</p>
